      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOWERING EARL (6) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing fifth (30.46) in a NG at Gosford. Generally safe to begin but was always well back last time. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has winning claims on his best figures. SUPER SASSY (1) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (30.29) last time in a NG at Gosford. Has a good record at this journey. Better than last start and can bounce back. GRANT KEEPING (2) tends to drift back and work into the race, charging home into the minors two back before winding up late into second (29.69) in a Grade 3/4 at this track last time. Form here sound including two wins. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Well-placed to take this out. RITZA TIANA (4) was in the money last time at The Gardens (29.58) in a NG, finishing a 2.75 lengths second. Has already won two times from this draw.",
